        {
          "text": "Gaafasi lafti ch'ite worra liqimsite, worri Korafi worra goli isaa, gaafa ibidi nama 250 hobaase kaani woliini hobaani; worri gorsa gumii tahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
